    "detailed_description": "<h1>Environmental Puzzles</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/extras/c795d502d833445b004f7b13d92e43f9.avif?t=1748508914\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use notes, clues, and observations to solve puzzles. Sometimes the answer is right in front of you \u2014 and sometimes it\u2019s hidden in the shadows.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground</strong> is a first-person horror adventure where you wake up lost, with no memory of how you got here \u2014 and no idea where &quot;home&quot; is. As you explore a strange and seemingly abandoned subway system, you begin to uncover notes, clues, and puzzles that guide you from station to station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not alone down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive encounters with terrifying entities that stalk the tunnels. Make decisions that affect your survival, and solve increasingly complex puzzles that block your escape. Each station presents a unique challenge \u2014 from tracking down the right medication for a patient under time pressure, to escaping a deadly chase after choosing the wrong item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven single-player horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple underground stations</strong>, each with its own set of puzzles, atmosphere, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints</strong> between stations so progress isn\u2019t lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mix of stealth, puzzle-solving, and decision-based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic horror elements</strong> that react to your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI for full immersion</strong></p></li></ul>",
